This folder contains test cases for the e-commerce price filter.

## Testing objective
Verify that the price filter displays only available products with a price equal to or below $1000.

## Test cases
- TC-001: Verify products below $1000.
- TC-004: Verify unavailable products are excluded.
- TC-006: Verify a product priced exactly $1000.
- TC-007: Verify products above $1000 are excluded.
